      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Agent runs side by side: each run of a panel is decided look by look by one agent, a Claude Code session or a person. Pick the experiment and the agents above, then **click an agent's name** in the first table to set the time range to its window. Scores come from `lpbot agent evaluate`: each decision against staying in cash and against holding what was open, over the agent's own next look and the horizons scored. Load with `lpbot agent evaluate <experiment>`, `lpbot run <experiment>`, then `make load`. The **Now** row shows every forward agent's state at this minute, from `lpbot supervisor status --load`, which `deploy/agents/refresh.sh --looks` runs every minute."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Now",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
