    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Every look: what the agent saw, decided, expected and why",
      "description": "One row a look, oldest first. Ranges and bands are in percent from the price at the look. The score is over the agent's own next look. In a forward or live panel, the questions the look asked the other agents on the board, the answers it had (on time or late, read before deciding or not) and who did not answer. Hover or click a reasoning cell to read it whole; the run's Markdown log (data/agent/<panel>/<agent>.log.md) has the same with the full view the agent saw.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "results"
